      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you hire a bike transporter from Nashik to Pune, the journey is usually straightforward—pick‑up, secure the bike, and deliver. However, some unscrupulous operators take advantage of last‑minute changes and add hidden fees that inflate the final bill.</p>

<p>These “moving‑day surcharges” are typically levied for:</p>

