    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Mid-Month Moves:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Generally, transportation companies have higher demand and charges at the beginning and end of the month. By moving your bike during the mid-month, you can avoid peak season rates and secure a better deal.</p>
