    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Month-End Moves:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">On the other hand, some companies might offer discounts or promotions to clear their inventory at the month's end. Keep an eye out for such offers and take advantage of them to save on your bike transport.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<h3>Advance Reservation Discounts</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Book Early:</strong> Many transportation companies offer early bird discounts for bookings made several days, weeks, or even months in advance. By planning ahead and making your reservation early, you can secure a lower rate.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Last-Minute Deals:</strong> Some companies may reduce prices for last-minute bookings due to unsold slots or to fill up remaining capacity. Keep an eye out for such offers and be flexible with your moving dates.</span></li>
