	<h3>Milestone Payment Schedules</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Lump-Sum Payment:</strong> Many transportation providers offer discounts for making the entire payment at the time of booking. This can save you money compared to paying in installments.</span></li>
